*█archetype with no exact list and no claimed card support.█The machine-readable target list is█`decks/starter-corpus/manifest.json` (schema `version: 1`). Its `status` field is█`planned`, `implemented` or `certified`; planned entries have `deck_path: null`█because no exact, sourced list has been constructed for them yet.█## Target archetypes█| id | commander | style | status |█| --- | --- | --- | --- |█| `isamaru-white-aggro` | Isamaru, Hound of Konda | white aggressive one-drop | planned |█| `jasmine-vanilla-stompy` | Jasmine Boreal | green/white vanilla-creature stompy | implemented |█| `talrand-draw-go` | Talrand, Sky Summoner | blue draw-go spells-matter | planned |█| `krenko-goblin-tokens` | Krenko, Mob Boss | red goblin token swarm | planned |█| `ayula-bear-counters` | Ayula, Queen Among Bears | green bear tribal +1/+1 counters | planned |█| `elas-sacrifice` | Elas il-Kor, Sadistic Pilgrim | white/black sacrifice/drain | [...6119ch elided...] an authoritative printing (Scryfall printing█endpoint or official Gatherer) with a retrieval date. No card name, cost,█type line, power/toughness or Oracle text is authored by hand.█* Format legality, engine support and actual gameplay support are reported█separately. A legal/supported list is still not Commander format gameplay.█## Practical limitations█* The game/replay journey is a local 2-4-seat deterministic heuristic run under█the explicit bounded 40-life Commander-combat practice profile; it is not█networked multiplayer or full Commander.█* The AI is the existing deterministic heuristic. This package adds no█strategy tuning.█* The native UI's bundled table still defaults to the practice decks; the█starter corpus is exercised through the CLI with explicit deck paths.\u000f█</out>█read(path=\"decks/starter-corpus/jasmine-vanilla-stompy.txt\")//Reading starter deck list█<out>█\u000e// jasmine-vanilla-stompy - 99-card library; commander supplied separately: Jasmine Boreal█// Green/white vanilla-creature stompy. Every 